s episode reward/done/info. With auto_reset=False, handle termination before stepping again.","limitations","guidance","list","Setup","ordered",true,"items",[73,74,75],"setup","Run pip install craftax in an isolated Python environment.","Run play_craftax or play_craftax_classic for manual play.","Select Craftax-Pixels-v1 or Craftax-Symbolic-v1 explicitly; keep full Craftax and Craftax-Classic separate. Supply distinct JAX keys to reset and step, and record the auto_reset setting.","Try these tasks",false,[80,81,82],"testTasks","Compare survival and crafting progress using identical seeded worlds.","Separate image-only policies from symbolic-state policies.","Modify a block or recipe, invalidate texture caches when necessary, and check reset behavior.","AI use and evaluation boundary","Fix observation mode, PRNG keys, episode handling and package version. Version changes affect comparability: 1.5.0 fixes first-planted-plant growth, and 1.6.0 fixes Craftax-Classic death rewards.","aiUseNote","links","Supporting evidence",[90,91,92],"evidence",{"_54":97,"_25":98},{"_54":95,"_25":96},{"_54":93,"_25":94},"Pinned auto-reset transition implementation","https://github.com/MichaelTMatthews/Craftax/blob/c3c2e0d038c4e641f9481320c158f457f30c28f3/craftax/environment_base/environment_bases.py","Game tutorial","https://github.com/MichaelTMatthews/Craftax/blob/main/tutorial.md","Installation, API and reset caveats","https://github.com/MichaelTMatthews/Craftax#readme","Read the terms",[102],"licenseUrl",{"_54":99,"_25":103},"https://github.com/MichaelTMatthews/Craftax/blob/main/LICENSE","Terms category","Open-license sources","terms","provenance","Asset license","Repository material under its MIT notice; added assets need separate records.","assetLicense","Code license","MIT.","codeLicense","Get started",[117],"access",{"_54":118,"_25":98,"_119":120},"Free Python package","note","CPU JAX is installed by default; accelerator support needs the correct JAX build.","Primary source",[124